---
const whatsappBaseUrl = "https://wa.me/5535988215162";
const heroWhatsappUrl = `${whatsappBaseUrl}?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20Dr.%20Luciano.%20Gostaria%20de%20agendar%20uma%20avalia%C3%A7%C3%A3o`;
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contato" class="bg-brand-dark text-white text-base pt-16 pb-28 sm:pb-16 border-t border-brand-pale/20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 mb-14">
      
      <!-- Coluna 1: Identificação Institucional e Logo Completa -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-start">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex bg-white rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-md border border-white/20 mb-5 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white" aria-label="Luciano Alves Freire, Consultório Odontológico, Implantodontia e Ortodontia">
          <img
            src="/images/logo-completa.svg"
            alt="Luciano Alves Freire, Consultório Odontológico, Implantodontia e Ortodontia"
            class="h-14 sm:h-16 w-auto object-contain shrink-0"
            width="164"
            height="64"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-white leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-4 text-base">
          Mais de 21 anos de dedicação clínica em Implantodontia e Ortodontia no Centro de Passos/MG. Atendimento individualizado, rigor técnico e foco no conforto do paciente.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white font-medium text-base">
          Responsável Técnico: Dr. Luciano Alves Freire • Cirurgião-Dentista • CRO MG 25.170
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 2: Navegação Rápida (Fontes >= 16px) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-white text-xl mb-4 tracking-tight">Navegação</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li><a href="/#triagem" class="text-white hover:text-brand-light underline-offset-4 hover:underline transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">Tratamentos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#comparador" class="text-white hover:text-brand-light underline-offset-4 hover:underline transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">Comparador Anatômico</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#autoridade" class="text-white hover:text-brand-light underline-offset-4 hover:underline transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">Dr. Luciano Freire</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#ambientes" class="text-white hover:text-brand-light underline-offset-4 hover:underline transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">Ambientes do Consultório</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#faq" class="text-white hover:text-brand-light underline-offset-4 hover:underline transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">Dúvidas Frequentes</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#contato" class="text-white hover:text-brand-light underline-offset-4 hover:underline transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">Localização e Contato</a></li>
          <li class="pt-2">
            <a href="#" class="btn-tactile inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-semibold hover:text-brand-light transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7m-7-7v18"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Voltar ao topo</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 3: Dados de Contato e Localização Oficiais -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-white text-xl mb-4 tracking-tight">Consultório</h2>
        <address class="not-italic space-y-2.5 leading-relaxed text-white">
          <p class="font-semibold text-white">Rua dos Brandões, 231, Sala 24 – Centro</p>
          <p>Passos - MG, CEP 37.900-104</p>
          <p class="pt-1">
            <strong>Horário:</strong> Segunda a sexta, das 13h30 às 18h30 <span class="block text-white font-medium text-base">(com agendamento prévio)</span>
          </p>
          <p class="pt-2">
            <strong>WhatsApp Oficial:</strong>
            <a href={heroWhatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block font-bold text-white underline hover:text-brand-light transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              (35) 98821-5162
            </a>
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>E-mail:</strong>
            <a href="mailto:drlucianofreire@uol.com.br" class="block underline hover:text-brand-light transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              drlucianofreire@uol.com.br
            </a>
          </p>
        </address>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Linha Divisória e Nota Ética CFO/CRO (Fontes >= 16px) -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-center md:text-left text-white text-base">
      <div>
        <p class="text-white font-medium">© {currentYear} Dr. Luciano Alves Freire. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-white text-base max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
          Informações de caráter educativo e informativo. Conforme resoluções do Conselho Federal de Odontologia (CFO), o conteúdo não substitui a consulta odontológica presencial.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="shrink-0 text-white font-semibold text-base">
        Passos • Minas Gerais
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
